<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>成就一览</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --md-primary-color: #673AB7;
            --md-background-color: #f5f5f5;
            --md-surface-color: #ffffff;
            --md-text-primary: #212121;
            --md-text-secondary: #757575;
            --md-unlocked-color: var(--md-primary-color);
            --md-locked-color: #BDBDBD;
            --md-legendary-color: #FFC107;
            --md-legendary-glow: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.4);
            --md-epic-color: #9C27B0;
            --md-epic-glow: rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.3);
            --md-animation-curve: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN';
            src: local('Source Han Sans CN'), local('思源黑体');
        }
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'Source Han Serif CN';
            src: local('Source Han Serif CN'), local('思源宋体');
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        @keyframes legendary-glow {
            0% { box-shadow: 0 0 5px var(--md-legendary-glow), 0 0 10px var(--md-legendary-glow); }
            50% { box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--md-legendary-glow), 0 0 25px var(--md-legendary-glow); }
            100% { box-shadow: 0 0 5px var(--md-legendary-glow), 0 0 10px var(--md-legendary-glow); }
        }
        @keyframes epic-glow {
            0% { box-shadow: 0 0 5px var(--md-epic-glow), 0 0 10px var(--md-epic-glow); }
            50% { box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--md-epic-glow), 0 0 20px var(--md-epic-glow); }
            100% { box-shadow: 0 0 5px var(--md-epic-glow), 0 0 10px var(--md-epic-glow); }
        }
        body {
            background-color: transparent;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 10px;
            font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', '思源黑体', sans-serif;
            color: var(--md-text-primary);
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        }
        .achievement-panel {
            background-color: var(--md-surface-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            max-width: 420px;
            margin: auto;
            overflow: hidden;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(10px);
            transition: opacity 0.5s var(--md-animation-curve), transform 0.5s var(--md-animation-curve);
        }
        .achievement-panel.loaded {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
        .panel-header {
            background-color: var(--md-primary-color);
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 500;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .search-container {
            position: relative;
        }
        #achievement-search {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 4px 8px 4px 28px;
            width: 120px;
            font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', '思源黑体', sans-serif;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: white;
            transition: all 0.3s var(--md-animation-curve);
        }
        #achievement-search:focus {
            outline: none;
            width: 160px;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
        }
        #achievement-search::placeholder {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
        }
        .search-icon {
            position: absolute;
            left: 6px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            fill: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .tag-filter-container {
            padding: 8px 12px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .tag-button {
            background-color: #e0e0e0;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            font-family: 'Source Han Sans CN', '思源黑体', sans-serif;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--md-text-secondary);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s var(--md-animation-curve);
        }
        .tag-button:hover {
            background-color: #d1d1d1;
        }
        .tag-button.active {
            background-color: var(--md-primary-color);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(103, 58, 183, 0.3);
        }
        .tag-button[data-tag="传说"].active {
            background-color: var(--md-legendary-color);
            color: var(--md-text-primary);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.4);
        }
        .tag-button[data-tag="史诗"].active {
            background-color: var(--md-epic-color);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.4);
        }
        .achievement-list {
            max-height: 450px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 4px 8px;
        }
        .achievement-list::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
        }
        .achievement-list::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: transparent;
        }
        .achievement-list::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #ccc;
            border-radius: 3px;
        }
        .achievement-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, opacity 0.4s ease;
            filter: grayscale(1);
            opacity: 0.7;
        }
        .achievement-item:hover {
            background-color: var(--md-background-color);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        }
        .achievement-item.unlocked {
            filter: grayscale(0);
            opacity: 1;
        }
        .achievement-item.legendary.unlocked {
            animation: legendary-glow 3s infinite ease-in-out;
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%, var(--md-legendary-glow), transparent 70%);
        }
        .achievement-item.epic.unlocked {
            animation: epic-glow 3s infinite ease-in-out;
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 90% 90%, var(--md-epic-glow), transparent 70%);
        }
        .achievement-icon {
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            margin-right: 14px;
            margin-top: 1px;
            transition: transform 0.4s var(--md-animation-curve);
        }
        .unlocked .achievement-icon {
            transform: scale(1.1) rotate(-5deg);
        }
        .achievement-icon svg {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            fill: var(--md-locked-color);
            transition: fill 0.5s var(--md-animation-curve);
        }
        .unlocked .achievement-icon svg {
            fill: var(--md-unlocked-color);
        }
        .legendary.unlocked .achievement-icon svg {
            fill: var(--md-legendary-color);
        }
        .epic.unlocked .achievement-icon svg {
            fill: var(--md-epic-color);
        }
        .achievement-details {
            flex-grow: 1;
            color: var(--md-locked-color);
            transition: color 0.5s var(--md-animation-curve);
            display: grid;
            grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
        }
        .unlocked .achievement-details {
            color: var(--md-text-primary);
        }
        .achievement-title {
            font-family: 'Source Han Serif CN', '思源宋体', serif;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin: 0 0 2px 0;
            line-height: 1.4;
            transition: color 0.5s var(--md-animation-curve);
        }
        .unlocked .achievement-title {
            color: var(--md-text-primary);
        }
        .legendary.unlocked .achievement-title {
            color: #c79100;
        }
        .epic.unlocked .achievement-title {
            color: var(--md-epic-color);
        }
        .achievement-description {
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            color: var(--md-text-secondary);
        }
        .condition-wrapper {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-rows: 0fr;
            transition: grid-template-rows 0.4s var(--md-animation-curve);
        }
        .condition-wrapper.expanded {
            grid-template-rows: 1fr;
        }
        .achievement-condition {
            overflow: hidden;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--md-text-secondary);
            opacity: 0.8;
            padding-top: 6px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="achievement-panel" id="achievement-panel">
    <div class="panel-header">
        <span>成就一览</span>
        <div class="search-container">
            <svg class="search-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15.5 14h-.79l-.28-.27C15.41 12.59 16 11.11 16 9.5 16 5.91 13.09 3 9.5 3S3 5.91 3 9.5 5.91 16 9.5 16c1.61 0 3.09-.59 4.23-1.57l.27.28v.79l5 4.99L20.49 19l-4.99-5zm-6 0C7.01 14 5 11.99 5 9.5S7.01 5 9.5 5 14 7.01 14 9.5 11.99 14 9.5 14z"></path></svg>
            <input type="text" id="achievement-search" placeholder="搜索成就…">
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tag-filter-container">
        <button class="tag-button active" data-tag="all">全部</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="桃子">桃子</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="小柴俊">小柴俊</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="辉夜">辉夜</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="观月">观月</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="朔">朔</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="咏">咏</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="澄">澄</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="琴叶">琴叶</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="瑞穗">瑞穗</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="弥生">弥生</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="诗织">诗织</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="千景">千景</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="朱夏">朱夏</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="小夜">小夜</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="母女">母女</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="姐妹">姐妹</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="祖孙">祖孙</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="多人">多人</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="史诗">史诗</button>
        <button class="tag-button" data-tag="传说">传说</button>
    </div>
    <div class="achievement-list">
        <div class="achievement-item" id="ach-tixianmuou" data-tags="桃子">
            <div class="achievement-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M62,45 l-10,10 l-10,-10 l-10,10 l10,10 l-10,10 l10,10 l10,-10 l10,10 l10,-10 l-10,-10 Z M50,10 l0,20 M40,30 l-10,-10 M60,30 l10,-10 M30,50 l-20,0 M70,50 l20,0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M50,30 a10,10 0 1,0 0.001,0 Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" fill="none"/><path d="M45,25 l-15,-15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="5,5"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="achievement-details">
                <div>
                    <p class="achievement-title">提线木偶的第一步</p>
                    <p class="achievement-description">当看不见的丝线开始牵动，舞台上的木偶迈出了她不由自主的第一步。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="condition-wrapper">
                    <p class="achievement-condition">解锁：桃子首次执行丈夫的引诱指令。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="achievement-item" id="ach-mitao" data-tags="桃子">
            <div class="achievement-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M50,90 C20,90 20,50 50,50 S80,90 50,90 Z" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M50,50 C80,50 80,10 50,10 S20,50 50,50 Z" fill="#90EE90" opacity="0.7"/><path d="M50,10 C55,20 60,10 60,5 C50,0 50,10 50,10 Z" fill="#6B8E23"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="achievement-details">
                <div>
                    <p class="achievement-title">蜜桃成熟时？</p>
                    <p class="achievement-description">那颗青涩的果实，在不属于它的季节，被强行催熟。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="condition-wrapper">
                    <p class="achievement-condition">解锁：与桃子发生首次实质性肢体接触。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="achievement-item" id="ach-honghen" data-tags="桃子">
            <div class="achievement-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M50,95 C 20,65 50,20 50,20 C 50,20 80,65 50,95 Z" fill="#DC143C"/><path d="M20,40 Q50,70 80,40 Q50,10 20,40 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" opacity="0.8"/></svg></div>
            <div class="achievement-details">
                <div><p class="achievement-title">红痕之契</p><p class="achievement-description">以贞洁为祭品，以痛楚为印记，一场荒诞的治疗订下了它最残酷的契约。</p></div>
                <div class="condition-wrapper"><p class="achievement-condition">解锁：桃子献出自己的第一次。</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="achievement-item" id="ach-pandora" data-tags="桃子">
            <div class="achievement-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><rect x="15" y="30" width="70" height="50" rx="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" fill="none"/><path d="M15,35 L85,35 M50,20 L50,30" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5"/><path d="M15,35 L25,25 L75,25 L85,35" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" fill="none"/><path d="M50,35 L50,80" stroke="#FFD700" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="3,3"/></svg></div>
            <div class="achievement-details">
                <div><p class="achievement-title">潘多拉的缝隙</p><p class="achievement-description">禁忌的魔盒被撬开了一道微光，从中飞出的，是灾厄，还是希望？</p></div>
                <div class="condition-wrapper"><p class="achievement-condition">解锁：桃子对丈夫的忠诚度首次出现实质性动摇。</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="achievement-item" id="ach-xuedinger" data-tags="桃子 小柴俊">
            <div class="achievement-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><rect x="10" y="10" width="80" height="80" rx="5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.2)" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M50,30 C40,30 35,40 35,50 S40,70 50,70 S65,60 65,50 S60,30 50,30 Z M40,35 L35,25 M60,35 L65,25" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" opacity="0.5"/></svg></div>
            <div class="achievement-details">
                <div><p class="achievement-title">薛定谔的“治愈”</p><p class="achievement-description">在“观测”完成之前，他的康复同时处于“成功”和“失败”的叠加态。</p></div>
                <div class="condition-wrapper"><p class="achievement-condition">解锁：小柴俊的康复度达到关键阈值。</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="achievement-item" id="ach-yasaxi" data-tags="桃子">
            <div class="achievement-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M20,40 C0,60 20,80 50,95 C80,80 100,60 80,40 C60,20 50,30 50,50 C50,30 40,20 20,40 Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-dasharray="5,5"/><path d="M70,20 a15,15 0 0,0 -20,-10 l-5,15 l15,5 a15,15 0 0,0 10,-10 Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div>
            <div class="achievement-details">
                <div><p class="achievement-title">万恶的亚撒西</p><p class="achievement-description">在这场危险的游戏中，她发现了一个意料之外的安全区。原来，最强大的武器是温柔。</p></div>
                <div class="condition-wrapper"><p class="achievement-condition">解锁：桃子的好感度达到基础信任水平。</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="achievement-item" id="ach-tianping" data-tags="桃子">
            <div class="achievement-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M10,30 L90,30 M50,30 L50,90 M45,85 L55,95 L45,95 Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" fill="none"/><path d="M20,30 L30,70 L10,70 Z" fill="currentColor" transform="rotate(-15 20 50)"/><path d="M80,30 L90,50 L70,50 Z" fill="currentColor" transform="rotate(-15 80 40)"/></svg></div>
            <div class="achievement-details">
                <div><p class="achievement-title">我的天平，正在失重</p><p class="achievement-description">她心中的天平，一端是责任，另一端却因{{User}}的存在而变得轻盈。</p></div>
                <div class="condition-wrapper"><p class="achievement-condition">解锁：桃子的好感度开始明确偏移。</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="achievement-item" id="ach-tokyo" data-tags="桃子">
            <div class="achievement-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M50,95 L50,10 M40,10 L60,10 M30,30 L70,30 M20,50 L80,50 M30,70 L70,70 M45,10 L55,10 L55,5 L45,5 Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="6" fill="none"/></svg></div>
            <div class="achievement-details">
                <div><p class="achievement-title">东京爱情故事</p><p class="achievement-description">不是在东京，却上演着同样无法预料的爱情故事。</p></div>
                <div class="condition-wrapper"><p class="achievement-condition">解锁：桃子的爱意已然萌生。</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="achievement-item" id="ach-shenti" data-tags="桃子">
            <div class="achievement-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M20,50 C20,20 80,20 80,50 S20,80 20,50 Z M80,50 C80,80 20,80 20,50" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" fill="none"/><path d="M40,60 Q50,70 60,60 Q50,50 40,60" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div>
            <div class="achievement-details">
                <div><p class="achievement-title">身体的记忆比嘴诚实</p><p class="achievement-description">意志还在说着“不可以”，但身体已经悄悄记下了每一次战栗的频率。</p></div>
                <div class="condition-wrapper"><p class="achievement-condition">解锁：桃子的身体与精神防线初次被实质性突破。</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="achievement-item" id="ach-lizhi" data-tags="桃子">
            <div class="achievement-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M10,50 H90" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="8"/><path d="M40,50 l-5,-20 l10,0 l-5,20 M60,50 l5,20 l-10,0 l5,-20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" fill="none"/><path d="M50,50 C 30,70 20,90 10,95 M50,50 C 70,70 80,90 90,95" stroke="#4682B4" stroke-width="4" fill="none"/></svg></div>
            <div class="achievement-details">
                <div><p class="achievement-title">理智的决堤</p><p class="achievement-description">名为“理智”的堤坝，在快感洪流的反复冲击下，终于崩溃决口。</p></div>
                <div class="condition-wrapper"><p class="achievement-condition">解锁：桃子首次达到生理高潮。</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="achievement-item" id="ach-jingzi" data-tags="桃子">
            <div class="achievement-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" fill="none"/><path d="M15,85 L85,15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M35,60 a5,5 0 1,1 0,-0.01 M30,45 q5,5 10,0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M65,40 a5,5 0 1,0 0,0.01 M70,55 q-5,-5 -10,0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/></svg></div>
            <div class="achievement-details">
                <div><p class="achievement-title">镜啊镜啊，谁是我？</p><p class="achievement-description">她看着镜中那个陌生的女人，不禁迷茫地发问：哪一个才是真实？</p></div>
                <div class="condition-wrapper"><p class="achievement-condition">解锁：桃子对自身的认知开始分裂。</p></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="achievement-item" id="ach-shenle" data-tags="桃子">
            <div class="achievement-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M50,90 C20,90 20,50 50,50 S80,90 50,90 Z M50,80 C30,80 30,55 50,55 S70,80 50,80 Z M50,70 C40,70 40,60 50,60 S60,70 50,70 Z" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M50,50 C 20,20 80,20 50,50" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" fill="none"/></svg></div>
            <div class="achievement-details">
                <div><p class="achievement-title">神乐之器，觉醒</p><p class="achievement-description">沉睡的乐器终于被奏响了它真正的乐章，只为自身的欢愉而震颤。</p></div>
                <div class="condition-wrapper"><p class="achievement-condition">解锁：桃子彻底接受并主导自己的欲望。</p></div>
            </div>
